  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Are You Experienced**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Give Me a Sign**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Lay Away**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2014-03-08.BBLV** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 10 songs; 67 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- George Porter Jr. sat in and played on every song of the night [1]\n- The show helped open the new Brooklyn Bowl Las Vegas venue [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2014-03-08.BBLV**: taped by HClayton; transferred by HClayton; source: Franken-NAKS CM300 CP-1 (open) > GAKables > Niant PFA > Naiant Biggest Box > Tascam DR-07 Taped Left of Board/Almost Center [1]. Also: The taper's memory card failed during the second set, so only one set was captured, though two were played [1]",
